@prefix ex: <https://example.org/learning/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
ex:ClaimC a rdf:Statement, prov:Entity ; rdf:subject ex:Maya ; rdf:predicate ex:maintains ; rdf:object ex:LoginService ; prov:wasDerivedFrom ex:Receipt1 .
ex:Receipt1 a prov:Entity .
# Describing an rdf:Statement does not itself assert that statement.
